direction: right
Ingress: Ingress gateway {shape: hexagon}
ServiceA: Orders service {shape: rectangle}
ProxyA: Sidecar proxy A {shape: hexagon}
ServiceB: Inventory service {shape: rectangle}
ProxyB: Sidecar proxy B {shape: hexagon}
ServiceC: Payments service {shape: rectangle}
ProxyC: Sidecar proxy C {shape: hexagon}
Control: Mesh control plane {shape: cloud}
Telemetry: Telemetry backend {shape: stored_data}
Ingress -> ProxyA
ProxyA -> ServiceA
ProxyA -> ProxyB: mTLS
ProxyB -> ServiceB
ProxyB -> ProxyC: mTLS
ProxyC -> ServiceC
Control -> ProxyA: policy
Control -> ProxyB: policy
Control -> ProxyC: policy
ProxyA -> Telemetry
ProxyB -> Telemetry
ProxyC -> Telemetry
